, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:31:37Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Alemania is Spanish, Saksa is Finnish, Saksamaa is Estonian, Niemcy is Polish, Vokjetija is Lithuanian, Doitsu is Japanese as you already cracked", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:35:49Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "I did start learning Spanish and Estonian both, but studied till only A1. Like all hobbies and interests I pick up, I move on to the next one too quickly 😔", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:36:08Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "same for me with French", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:36:54Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Allemagne is what they call Germany by the way", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:37:56Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Yup, similar in Italian too", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:38:40Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Why would alemania be a direct hint? What does it mean?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:38:51Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Like besides Germany", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:39:18Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Finnish and Estonian are similar as languages, so they have the same/similar word as well. Tyskland in the Nordics is an alteration of Deutschland", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:40:17Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "I don't think it means anything except for the country, just the fact that Germany is called differently in Spanish", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:40:29Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Oh ok", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:41:11Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "If you are learning Spanish in India, for instance, you might not even come across the word Germany in the beginning stages to know the word, I guess.", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T06:42:02Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Yeah", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]